## Financing Judgment

| Assumption | Value | Label | Reason |
|---|---|---|---|
| New long-term borrowing | 300 million in 2030; zero in 2026–2029 | judgment | Fund the projected 266.25 million shortfall with a modest cushion, without increasing the 235 million revolver limit. |

This is additional to the refinancing already assumed. The 2025 10-K discusses seeking debt or equity financing if needed (mp-10k2026.pdf, PDF p. 100), but does not promise this loan. The model adds the borrowing to debt and FCFE. Under its existing opening-balance interest convention, interest on this loan starts in 2031. Operating assumptions and all balance and liquidity checks remain unchanged.

